{Backstory=As part of his efforts to cure Grineer cloning decay syndrome, Tyl Regor has built secret underwater research facilities deep in the ocean of Uranus and his research soon bears fruit in the form of "spawns", Grineer specimens that are stronger and healthier than normal. 
